<Layout title="Privacy & accessibility"><section class="shell legal-page"><h1>Privacy & accessibility</h1><h2>Visiting this website</h2><p>This is a static website. It has no contact forms, advertising, site analytics, AI services, or visitor accounts. The hosting provider processes technical information needed to serve pages, including IP addresses and request logs. External links open services with their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Instagram content</h2><p>Instagram profile and post content load only after you choose its load button. Doing so connects your browser to Meta, which can receive your IP address, browser information, and cookies under its own policies. Posts may be unavailable if an account is private, a post is deleted, embeds are disabled, or your browser blocks Instagram. The direct post link remains available.</p><h2>Student information and photographs</h2><p>Student editors should publish names, images, and identifying details only with appropriate school permission. Do not upload private records or personal contact information. Files and content saved in a public GitHub repository can remain in its history after removal from the website.</p><h2>Editor sign-in</h2><p>Authorized editors use individual GitHub accounts. GitHub controls repository access. The self-hosted authentication service handles sign-in; the site does not have its own password database. Sign out on shared computers.</p><h2>Accessibility</h2><p>The site supports keyboard navigation, visible focus indicators, alternative text, reduced motion preferences, and responsive layouts. If content is difficult to access, contact the school office through the Get Involved page and ask for the leadership advisor.</p><a class="button dark" href="/contact/">Contact the school ↗</a></section></Layout>
